# Testing, Performance, and Tooling

Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: M1-M2
Dependencies: `01_PROJECT_FOUNDATION.todo`; expands with every gameplay system

## Purpose

Make correctness, performance, configuration, and debugging visible and repeatable.

## Tasks

- [ ] Configure Unity Test Framework.
- [ ] Add domain test conventions.
- [ ] Add PlayMode smoke framework.
- [ ] Add deterministic match seed support.
- [ ] Add performance markers.
- [ ] Add development diagnostics overlay.
- [ ] Add territory visualization modes.
- [ ] Add configuration validator.
- [ ] Add missing-reference validator.
- [ ] Add batch test command.
- [ ] Add batch development-build command.
- [ ] Add performance scenario runner.
- [ ] Define defect severity and triage template.
- [ ] Define playtest capture template.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Tests run locally and in batch mode.
- [ ] Core gameplay has no silent invalid-state fallback.
- [ ] Territory costs are measured under sustained load.
- [ ] Build validation catches missing scenes/configuration.
- [ ] Seed and key metrics are visible in development builds.
- [ ] Definition of done matches `docs/07_TESTING_AND_QUALITY.md`.

